  "plain": "A service worker can list every open tab of its site, and tabs can talk to each other.",
  "meaning": "clients.matchAll() returns the count, addresses, visibility and focus of every tab and window of the origin. BroadcastChannel lets same origin tabs message each other and notice one another.",
  "lifecycle": [
    "in-session"
  ],
  "space": "web",
